{"id": "soma-stabilization-fee-authority-code", "title": "San Francisco recorded $2.9 million in SoMa fees under the wrong authority code", "seconds": 43.5, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "tempo": 1.07, "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "9a068e98b128c6c3", "words": 147, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Two San Francisco development payments added up to nearly three million dollars.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.93, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Two", "receipts,", "one", "account"], "sub": "Two fee entries account for the rounded total", "source": "error19"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.27, 0.45, 0.98, 1.43, 1.89, 2.17, 2.3, 2.41, 2.69, 2.95, 3.23]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The operating ledger records $2,894,932.48.", "t0": 4.05, "t1": 7.51, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "error19", "layout": "table", "heading": "Two fiscal 2018–19 receipts", "context": "SoMa Community Stabilization Fee", "rows": [{"label": "15 Guy Place", "value": "$112,424"}, {"label": "390 1st Street", "value": "$2,782,508"}, {"label": "Total", "value": "$2,894,932"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.5, 0.75, 1.07, 1.3, 1.52, 1.77, 1.98, 2.26]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The Controller said the City deposited that revenue using the wrong authority code.", "t0": 7.73, "t1": 11.17, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "error19", "kicker": "The Controller documented a wrong authority code", "text": "The documented coding error", "mark": "The"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.51, 0.67, 0.77, 1.02, 1.49, 1.66, 2.08, 2.35, 2.46, 2.68, 3.06]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The City expected to fix it in fiscal 2019–20.", "t0": 11.29, "t1": 13.87, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "error19", "kicker": "The Controller documented a wrong authority code", "text": "The intended correction", "mark": "The"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.32, 0.68, 0.77, 1.0, 1.1, 1.19, 1.53, 1.78, 2.13, 2.21]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "In the following year, two entries in different departments cancel each other out.", "t0": 13.99, "t1": 17.59, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "entries", "layout": "table", "heading": "The fiscal 2019–20 offset", "context": "Different departments in the same fund", "rows": [{"label": "Planning", "value": "−$786,619.89"}, {"label": "Mayor’s Office", "value": "+$786,619.89"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.21, 0.56, 1.3, 1.56, 1.9, 1.99, 2.25, 2.72, 3.03, 3.18, 3.37]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Each was $786,619.89, a different amount from the original posting.", "t0": 17.71, "t1": 23.91, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "entries", "layout": "table", "heading": "The fiscal 2019–20 offset", "context": "Different departments in the same fund", "rows": [{"label": "Planning", "value": "−$786,619.89"}, {"label": "Mayor’s Office", "value": "+$786,619.89"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.34, 0.63, 0.92, 1.35, 2.11, 2.35, 2.59, 2.94, 3.24, 3.34, 3.76, 4.45, 4.56, 4.82, 5.1, 5.25, 5.36, 5.7]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The public ledger does not show the underlying authority codes.", "t0": 24.03, "t1": 26.52, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "entries", "kicker": "Two opposite ledger entries have a different amount", "text": "The missing accounting field", "mark": "The"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.38, 0.64, 0.81, 0.98, 1.17, 1.27, 1.63, 2.01]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Later, a separate $142,897 appeared in the summary but had no payer listed in the detail.", "t0": 26.74, "t1": 33.59, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "summary25", "layout": "table", "heading": "Fee summary and payer detail", "context": "City-held account, FY20–25", "rows": [{"label": "Summary total", "value": "$211,061"}, {"label": "Payer detail", "value": "$68,164"}, {"label": "Difference", "value": "$142,897"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.43, 0.55, 0.88, 1.07, 1.35, 1.92, 2.57, 2.81, 3.08, 3.59, 3.92, 4.22, 4.28, 4.37, 5.07, 5.25, 5.39, 5.57, 5.91, 6.21, 6.3, 6.4]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The public account places that revenue at the transportation agency.", "t0": 33.71, "t1": 36.51, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "entries", "layout": "table", "heading": "The separate FY21 entry", "context": "Municipal Transportation Agency", "rows": [{"label": "Public account", "value": "$142,896.59"}, {"label": "Rounded summary", "value": "$142,897"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.38, 0.7, 1.02, 1.18, 1.52, 1.61, 1.69, 2.32]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "A journal showing both authority codes would tell us whether the original error was fixed.", "t0": 36.63, "t1": 40.5, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "error19", "kicker": "A later report carried the balance and a separate revenue amount", "text": "The record needed to confirm the correction", "mark": "The"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.41, 0.66, 0.87, 1.29, 1.7, 1.89, 2.06, 2.15, 2.4, 2.53, 2.94, 3.2, 3.36]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 40.62, "t1": 42.62, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.6, 0.74, 0.99, 1.09, 1.18, 1.41, 1.64]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "Two fee entries account for the rounded total", "b": "The Controller documented a wrong authority code", "o": "A later report carried the balance and a separate revenue amount"}, "look": "midnight", "hook": "document"}